/*
  StaggerItem.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0194 · StaggerItem (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The web `components/motion/StaggerItem.tsx` is an
  anonymous motion wrapper — it renders no copy of its own and calls no `t()` — so there are NO web keys to
  mirror here. The only entries below are the native a11y additions for the empty-content leaf (the "never
  a blank box" peer of the wrapper hosting no children); the web simply renders an empty `motion.div`,
  while the native HIG calls for a labelled leaf.

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table ("StaggerItem") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings. In test /
  preview bundles `NSLocalizedString` returns the value below, keeping the labels deterministic.
*/

/* --- Native a11y additions (no web `t()` key exists; the source is anonymous) --- */

/* Title of the empty-content leaf, shown when the item has nothing to stagger. */
"staggerItem.empty" = "Nothing to show yet";

/* Supporting line of the empty-content leaf. */
"staggerItem.emptyMessage" = "Items appear here as they become available.";
